
# Please make sure that you have created Group, Cloud and configured IP Pool, Network portgroup before proceed the below steps.

Login to Morpheus Portal
Provisioning > Instances > Add
Select CentOS Image > Next 
Select Group > Cloud 
Provide the instance name > Next
Select version 7.5 > Layout "VMware VM" > Plan "1 CPU, 2GB Memory" > Resource Pool " dojo9-vmware " > Network " MGMT-PG " > Next > Next > Complete.


